- Low idle RAM consumption.
- Low CPU usage.
- Fast startup.
- Smooth rendering.
- Minimal dependencies.
- Event-driven processing.
- No unnecessary background services.
- No continuous polling.
- No cloud connection required for basic operations.
- No unnecessary allocations during pointer movement.
- Lazy loading of documents and images.
- Incremental autosave.
- Bounded undo history.
- Efficient caching.

